data.scenario:
World: [
Capital City Estitin: Main city of humans, where nobility and royalty live;
Elven Forest Elenoir: Sacred forest that unites the Kingdom of the Elves with that of Humans, it is characterized by its fearsome fog that does not allow us to see more than two meters forward;
Estitin Palace: Home of the Estitin royal family;
Medieval, fantasy, magic
]
Lore: [
Adventurers Guild: Guild that houses all the adventurers in the world regardless of race, located in Uruak;
Black Serpents: Group of adventurers who oppose royalty and seek power;
Black Serpents Members: Adventurers. who let themselves be carried away by money and are now mercenaries who do anything for money;
Golden Wings: Group of knights from the royal family of Estitin;
World: Divided into 3 parts reigned by different races: Elves in the East with the Euraphis Kingdom, Humans in the South with the Estitin Kingdom and finally the Dwarves in the North with the Dyarte Kingdom;
]
